Compile:
========
make compile_uart

Simulate in command mode:
=========================
make run test_name=uart_demo_test

Simulate in GUI mode for Siemens:
=================================
vsim top -voptargs=+acc +UVM_TESTNAME=uart_demo_test
log -r /*
run -a
<Select no when prompted>

Simulate in GUI mode for Cadence:
=================================
xrun -gui -access +rwc -uvm -top worklib.top +UVM_TESTNAME=uart_demo_test
